# Cable Trench: The Seabed, track 3 (SPEC 19.6). Down into the trench
# along the severed cable, the old internet's backbone, surfacing through
# the silt all the way round: steam from a ruptured repeater across the
# north reach, the trench's deep open on the right down the east side
# (leave the road and you fall), a loop down through the trench floor, a
# ramp across the break where the cable snapped, a second repeater venting
# on the west climb, a salt crust on the shelf at the top.
name CABLE TRENCH
order 3
floor silt
background trench
centerline yes
league seabed
width 50
pit_band 8
# x    y    half   features
 220  140   54                     # start line, heading east
 480  130   54     crates
 740  150   52     vent:left,period=300,warn=50   # a ruptured repeater
 890  260   50
 900  440   48     open:right      # the trench's deep on the right
 800  560   46
 640  510   46
 480  620   46
 560  720   46
 760  700   46
 880  800   48
 780  910   50     ramp            # across the break
 540  910   52
 320  900   52     crates
 170  780   50     vent:right,period=300,warn=50,phase=150
 150  600   50
 270  460   48     crust           # the shelf's salt crust
 180  330   50
 150  220   52
furrow 26 850 470 720 420 600 400 480 360 380 320
# the cable's two broken ends, either side of the road at the break
prop cable_end 642 834
prop cable_end 626 986
props periscope,buoy seg 1 side left gap 90 off 26
props container,anchor seg 14 side left gap 90 off 22
props periscope seg 7 side left gap 80 off 24
